{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 3, "A": 3, "C": 3, "V": 2},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.7, "A": 0.7, "C": 0.7, "V": 0.8},
  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据片段：'c hoose'、'cur ed'、't he' 等拼写和语法错误，例如在 'the client and/or the partner will c hoose the service provider' 中。解释：这些错误降低可读性，使需求难以理解。",
    "A": "证据片段：'sell it' 中的 'it' 指代不明（vouchers 是复数），以及 'each for Client and Partner' 在 'Each voucher should have two portions with three tear off voucher slips each for Client and Partner.' 中歧义。解释：代词和描述不明确导致对流程的多种解释可能。",
    "C": "证据片段：整体语法错误和拼写错误，如 'cur ed' 和 't he' 在 'If the patient is not cur ed then the doctor will refer t he patient to some other Hospitals'。解释：表述不准确可能影响业务规则的正确传达，导致误解。",
    "V": "证据片段：'enter those into the database' 中的 'those' 指代不明，以及 'create the vouchers' 无细节，在 'The VSP will submit the claim to VMIU field office to enter those into the database'。解释：缺乏具体操作和细节（如输入、输出、条件），无法定义可测试的用例。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "1. VMU shall create vouchers and sell them to clients through distributors. 2. Distributor shall submit sales details to VMU. 3. Each voucher shall have two portions: one for Client with three tear-off slips, and one for Partner with three tear-off slips. 4. Client or Partner shall select a Voucher Service Provider (VSP) and receive treatment. 5. The first visit is termed Consultation. If the patient is not cured, they may proceed to first follow-up and second follow-up visits. 6. If the patient is not cured after follow-ups, the doctor shall refer the patient to another hospital, which may be another VSP or any other hospital. 7. Details of each patient visit (including Diagnosis, Lab Tests, and Drugs) are termed a claim. 8. VSP shall submit the claim to the VMIU field office for entry into the database.",
    "A": "1. VMU shall create vouchers and sell them to clients through distributors. 2. Distributor shall submit sales details to VMU. 3. Each voucher shall have two portions: one for Client with three tear-off slips, and one for Partner with three tear-off slips. 4. Client or Partner shall select a Voucher Service Provider (VSP) and receive treatment. 5. The first visit is termed Consultation. If the patient is not cured, they may proceed to first follow-up and second follow-up visits. 6. If the patient is not cured after follow-ups, the doctor shall refer the patient to another hospital, which may be another VSP or any other hospital. 7. Details of each patient visit (including Diagnosis, Lab Tests, and Drugs) are termed a claim. 8. VSP shall submit the claim to the VMIU field office for entry into the database.",
    "C": "1. VMU shall create vouchers and sell them to clients through distributors. 2. Distributor shall submit sales details to VMU. 3. Each voucher shall have two portions: one for Client with three tear-off slips, and one for Partner with three tear-off slips. 4. Client or Partner shall select a Voucher Service Provider (VSP) and receive treatment. 5. The first visit is termed Consultation. If the patient is not cured, they may proceed to first follow-up and second follow-up visits. 6. If the patient is not cured after follow-ups, the doctor shall refer the patient to another hospital, which may be another VSP or any other hospital. 7. Details of each patient visit (including Diagnosis, Lab Tests, and Drugs) are termed a claim. 8. VSP shall submit the claim to the VMIU field office for entry into the database.",
    "V": "1. VMU shall create vouchers and sell them to clients through distributors. 2. Distributor shall submit sales details to VMU. 3. Each voucher shall have two portions: one for Client with three tear-off slips, and one for Partner with three tear-off slips. 4. Client or Partner shall select a Voucher Service Provider (VSP) and receive treatment. 5. The first visit is termed Consultation. If the patient is not cured, they may proceed to first follow-up and second follow-up visits. 6. If the patient is not cured after follow-ups, the doctor shall refer the patient to another hospital, which may be another VSP or any other hospital. 7. Details of each patient visit (including Diagnosis, Lab Tests, and Drugs) are termed a claim. 8. VSP shall submit the claim to the VMIU field office for entry into the database."
  },
  "issues": [
    {
      "type": "U",
      "evidence": "the client and/or the partner will c hoose the service provider",
      "rewrite": "Client or Partner shall select a Voucher Service Provider (VSP)"
    },
    {
      "type": "A",
      "evidence": "Each voucher should have two portions with three tear off voucher slips each for Client and Partner.",
      "rewrite": "Each voucher shall have two portions: one for Client with three tear-off slips, and one for Partner with three tear-off slips."
    },
    {
      "type": "C",
      "evidence": "If the patient is not cur ed then the doctor will refer t he patient to some other Hospitals the hospital may be another VSP or any other.",
      "rewrite": "If the patient is not cured after follow-ups, the doctor shall refer the patient to another hospital, which may be another VSP or any other hospital."
    },
    {
      "type": "V",
      "evidence": "The VSP will submit the claim to VMIU field office to enter those into the database",
      "rewrite": "VSP shall submit the claim to the VMIU field office for entry into the database."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 1, "C": 2, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.95, "A": 0.98, "C": 0.9, "V": 0.97},
  "rationales": {"U":"原文使用大量口语化、非专业术语及拼写错误（如'c hoose'、'cur ed'、't he'、'VSP'未定义），且混用被动/主动语态、无主语句式（如'First visit is called as Consultation'），导致阅读障碍；证据片段：'c hoose'、'cur ed'、't he'、'called as Consultation'、'VSP'未定义；这些破坏基础可理解性","A":"存在多处严重歧义：'two portions with three tear off voucher slips each for Client and Partner'无法确定是共6张还是各3张；'Client and/or the partner will choose the service provider'未明确决策权归属与冲突处理机制；'some other Hospitals the hospital may be another VSP or any other'中'any other'完全开放，无约束；证据片段：'two portions with three tear off voucher slips each for Client and Partner'、'Client and/or the partner'、'any other'","C":"存在事实性错误：'First visit is called as Consultation'将命名等同于业务含义，但Consultation是临床行为而非命名约定；'If the patient is not cured then...'隐含二值治愈判断，违背医学实际（如慢性病管理）；'Copyright © 2005 by Microcare Ltd'作为需求文本非法律或溯源信息，污染需求内容；证据片段：'First visit is called as Consultation'、'If the patient is not cured then...'、'Copyright © 2005 by Microcare Ltd'","V":"无任何可测试的判定标准：未定义'voucher creation'的触发条件、格式字段、唯一性约束；未定义'claim'的数据结构、必填字段、提交时限；未定义'follow up'的判定逻辑（如时间窗、诊断依据）；证据片段：'Each voucher should have two portions...'、'Each visit details... is called a claim'、'first follow up and second follow up'"}, 
  "suggestions": {"U":"Replace entire text with atomic, grammatically correct, domain-defined statements; define all acronyms (e.g., 'VSP = Verified Service Provider') on first use; fix all typos and normalize terminology.","A":"Specify exact voucher slip count per role: 'Each voucher SHALL consist of two physically separable portions: one portion containing three identical, sequentially numbered tear-off slips for the Client, and a second portion containing three identical, sequentially numbered tear-off slips for the Partner.'","C":"Replace medically unsound 'cured' logic with objective clinical criteria: 'A follow-up visit MAY be scheduled if the attending clinician documents in the patient record that the treatment plan requires re-evaluation within 7 days of the prior visit.' Remove copyright line entirely.","V":"Define verifiable claim requirements: 'A claim SHALL be a structured record containing exactly the following fields: visitTimestamp (ISO 8601), diagnosisCode (ICD-10), labTestNames (comma-separated list), drugNames (comma-separated list); the VSP SHALL submit the claim to the VMIU field office via HTTPS POST within 24 hours of visit completion.'"},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"c hoose","rewrite":"The client or the partner SHALL select a service provider from the approved list maintained by the VMU."},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"two portions with three tear off voucher slips each for Client and Partner","rewrite":"Each voucher SHALL consist of two physically separable portions: one portion containing three identical, sequentially numbered tear-off slips for the Client, and a second portion containing three identical, sequentially numbered tear-off slips for the Partner."},
    {"type":"C","evidence":"First visit is called as Consultation","rewrite":"The initial patient encounter with a clinician SHALL be recorded as a Consultation visit type in the system."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"Each visit details (including Diagnosis, Lab Test and Drugs) of the patient is called a claim","rewrite":"A claim SHALL be a structured record containing exactly the following fields: visitTimestamp (ISO 8601), diagnosisCode (ICD-10), labTestNames (comma-separated list), drugNames (comma-separated list); the VSP SHALL submit the claim to the VMIU field office via HTTPS POST within 24 hours of visit completion."}
  ]
}
